{"comment": "alice challenges bob to mancala sowing first, as south. Sowing runs counter-clockwise: south's pits 1-6 left to right, south's store, then north's pits 1-6 from north's left, and north's store. A last seed in the mover's store moves again, in its own empty pit it captures the pit facing it, and once a side is empty the other side's seeds go to their owner. North wins 36 to 12."}
